    "overview": "Vercel-inspired administration UI: neutral surfaces, crisp one-pixel borders, restrained density and clear type. The product opens on its operational content. No promotional hero, decorative gradients or invented metrics. The supplied luminous orbital logo retains its original colour in the header and favicon; its violet/cyan illumination is a brand signature, not a wash over every surface.\n\nTaste Skill 2.5.1 informs plain copy, consistent spacing, alignment, keyboard access and browser review. Its marketing-site rules (full-screen sections, hero animation, random layout deals, static exports) do not apply to an authenticated server-rendered control centre. The user selected the Vercel-inspired direction explicitly.",
